# 1.9.1: the release keystore + key.properties are COMMITTED on purpose so
# every CI build signs with the same stable key — Android refuses to install
# an update signed with a different key, which broke the in-app updater.
# Rotate + move to GitHub Secrets before any Play Store release.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
